"┌─[1]─St┌ Keybindings ─ Main ───────────────────────────────────────────┐──────┐"
"│◐ dev →│  j/↓  next run, or scroll a line                              │ult   │"
"│3 of 3 │  k/↑  previous run, or scroll a line                          │UNNING│"
"│◐ 1 · ✗│   ^D  ten runs or lines down                                  │UCCESS│"
"└───────│   ^U  ten runs or lines up                                    │AILED │"
"┌─[2]─Jo│Enter  open the run; on JSON and Output, page the text         │      │"
"│ 2h ◐ [│    /  search the text: highlights, hides nothing              │      │"
"│ 1d ✗ n│    n  next match                                              │      │"
"│    · w│    N  previous match                                          │      │"
"│       │l/]/→  next tab                                                │      │"
"│       │h/[/←  previous tab                                            │      │"
"│       │  Esc  back: close the run, then the panel                     │      │"
"│       │    x  actions menu                                            │      │"
"└───────│    r  refresh runs                                            │      │"
"┌─[3]─Pi│    o  open job in browser                                     │      │"
"│       │    y  copy: URL, run ID, job ID, name, JSON                   │──────┘"
"│       │    Y  copy the runs table as text                             │──────┐"
"│       │  0-4  focus panel by number                                   │  84ms│"
"└───────│  Tab  next side panel                                         │ 131ms│"
"┌─[4]─Co│    R  refresh everything                                      │      │"
"│       │    +  cycle screen mode                                       │      │"
"│       │    @  toggle the API log                                      │      │"
"└───────│    A  enable or disable actions this session                  │──────┘"
" Scroll:└───────────────────j/k: scroll │ Esc: close────────────────────┘ v0.1.0"
